  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NC:iecc:2015')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ncosfm.gov/codes/codes-current-and-past', 'e0914c902049f05463c7f0815db3fff74a829b92818ddbefbf2b63b19f56173b', 'The 2018 NC Codes (Effective 1/1/2019) include the 2018 NC Ad-Hoc Committee amendments as adopted by the Building Code Council and approved by the Rules Review Commission along with the 2015 International Codes. ... The following 2018 Codes were effective from January 1, 2019 and are currently effective.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NC:nec:2020')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ncosfm.gov/codes/codes-current-and-past', 'e0914c902049f05463c7f0815db3fff74a829b92818ddbefbf2b63b19f56173b', '2020 Electrical Code * Amendments *The 2020 Electrical Code was effective from November 1, 2021 and is currently effective.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('jurisdiction', 'NC', '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ncleg.gov/EnactedLegislation/Statutes/HTML/BySection/Chapter_143/GS_143-138.html', null, '(e) Effect upon Local Codes. - Except as otherwise provided in this section, the North Carolina State Building Code shall apply throughout the State, from the time of its adoption.', 'Statewide code model, re-checked on the official page.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:ibc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.medialibrary.nd.gov/assetbank-nd/assetfile/156311.pdf', '1546cd26ea804a9eeef629d87bd54efce0ddb4712d543d3e40559c8b6f683849', 'Effective January 1, 2026, the North Dakota State Building Code consists of the 2024 International Building Code (IBC), International Residential Code (IRC), International Mechanical Code (IMC), International Fuel Gas Code (IFGC), International Energy Conservation Code, and the International Existing Building Code as published by the International Code Council (ICC).', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:irc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.medialibrary.nd.gov/assetbank-nd/assetfile/156311.pdf', '1546cd26ea804a9eeef629d87bd54efce0ddb4712d543d3e40559c8b6f683849', 'Effective January 1, 2026, the North Dakota State Building Code consists of the 2024 International Building Code (IBC), International Residential Code (IRC), International Mechanical Code (IMC), International Fuel Gas Code (IFGC), International Energy Conservation Code, and the International Existing Building Code as published by the International Code Council (ICC).', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:imc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.medialibrary.nd.gov/assetbank-nd/assetfile/156311.pdf', '1546cd26ea804a9eeef629d87bd54efce0ddb4712d543d3e40559c8b6f683849', 'Effective January 1, 2026, the North Dakota State Building Code consists of the 2024 International Building Code (IBC), International Residential Code (IRC), International Mechanical Code (IMC), International Fuel Gas Code (IFGC), International Energy Conservation Code, and the International Existing Building Code as published by the International Code Council (ICC).', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:ifgc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.medialibrary.nd.gov/assetbank-nd/assetfile/156311.pdf', '1546cd26ea804a9eeef629d87bd54efce0ddb4712d543d3e40559c8b6f683849', 'Effective January 1, 2026, the North Dakota State Building Code consists of the 2024 International Building Code (IBC), International Residential Code (IRC), International Mechanical Code (IMC), International Fuel Gas Code (IFGC), International Energy Conservation Code, and the International Existing Building Code as published by the International Code Council (ICC).', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:iecc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.commerce.nd.gov/community-services/building-codes', '330694217086e366d7ff2d762b341196a7428ac586e66e1fd94e776738555e5c', 'The 2024 versions of the International Energy Conservation Code and the International Existing Building Code and proposed amendments to these codes were also adopted. The new North Dakota State Building Code will go into effect Jan. 1, 2026.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:iebc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.commerce.nd.gov/community-services/building-codes', '330694217086e366d7ff2d762b341196a7428ac586e66e1fd94e776738555e5c', 'The 2024 versions of the International Energy Conservation Code and the International Existing Building Code and proposed amendments to these codes were also adopted. The new North Dakota State Building Code will go into effect Jan. 1, 2026.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:nec:2026')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://ndlegis.gov/api/acdata/pdf/24.1-02-01.pdf', 'e65f417f2bb56a589bca1e190a0ef41c29b13bd28a441f7674fac86141415931', 'Whenever these requirements differ or are in conflict with the requirements of the NFPA 70 2026 edition, National Electrical Code (first version, printed in 2025) and NFPA 101 2024 edition Life Safety Code®, ... the more restrictive requirements are the minimum. ... History: Effective April 1, 2017; amended effective October 1, 2020; July 1, 2024; July 1, 2026.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:upc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://ndlegis.gov/api/acdata/pdf/62-03.1-01.pdf', '1c11e68d3d0934e1ce68e567e5dde4b52bb9887565f431672134725da7079cd0', 'The board adopts, as the state plumbing code, the 2018 edition of the Uniform Plumbing Code published by the international association of plumbing and mechanical officials (IAPMO), to be known as the 2018 North Dakota Plumbing Code ... History: Effective March 1, 2000; amended effective April 1, 2010; April 1, 2020.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:ND:ifc:2021')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://ndlegis.gov/api/acdata/pdf/45-18-01.pdf', '7a9ad90e8c14fba8d090e2afcc55808bcfbb879a2fae264c0012fd47864e9a4d', 'The State Fire Code includes: 1. The provisions of the State Building Code, effective January 1, 2023, providing for fire-safe construction and operation ... 2. The provisions of the International Fire Code (IFC), 2021 edition International Code Council (ICC), with the following exceptions and modifications ... History: Effective January 1, 2024.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('jurisdiction', 'ND', '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://ndlegis.gov/cencode/t54c21-3.pdf', null, 'The governing body of a city, township, or county that elects to administer and enforce a building code shall adopt and enforce the state building code. However, the state building code may be amended by cities, townships, and counties to conform to local needs.', 'Statewide code model, re-checked on the official page.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:ibc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=71-6403', '6c50dec22960cf81de232854884d64c6564d769cab97b65c0cce976a2a42ac96', '(a) The International Building Code (IBC), 2018 edition, except section 101.4.3 and chapter 29, published by the International Code Council', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:irc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=71-6403', '6c50dec22960cf81de232854884d64c6564d769cab97b65c0cce976a2a42ac96', '(b) The International Residential Code (IRC), 2018 edition, except section R313 and chapters 25 through 33, published by the International Code Council', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:iebc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=71-6403', '6c50dec22960cf81de232854884d64c6564d769cab97b65c0cce976a2a42ac96', '(c) The International Existing Building Code, 2018 edition, except section 809, published by the International Code Council', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:upc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=71-6403', '6c50dec22960cf81de232854884d64c6564d769cab97b65c0cce976a2a42ac96', '(d) The Uniform Plumbing Code, 2018 edition, designated by the American National Standards Institute as an American National Standard.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:iecc:2018')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=81-1609', 'cd9d73ff6fa31f81b11f8ebe8a27fae5f912113abefe5a2eab0828fd0bfb676f', '(9) Nebraska Energy Code means the 2018 International Energy Conservation Code published by the International Code Council;', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:nec:2023')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=81-2104', '8e937c4a4d4743c6f644bd3ccd9f795729c607c23b0d9b7060246835a6dc1230', 'the board shall be governed by the minimum standards set forth in the National Electrical Code issued and adopted by the National Fire Protection Association beginning in the 2023 edition of the National Electrical Code, Publication Number 70-2023 , except that the minimum standards set forth in the 2017 edition of the National Electrical Code shall apply for sections 210.8(A), 210.8(A)(3), 210.8(A)(5), 230.67(A), and 230.85.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NE:nfpa1:2012')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=81-503.01', 'cf6a66589305953e27a18d595e63cf1bcc0eddc4cde0f5c23238776e87d07db6', '(2) Not later than July 1, 2019, the rules and regulations adopted and promulgated as part of the State Fire Code shall conform generally to the standards recommended by the National Fire Protection Association, Pamphlet Number 1, known as the Fire Code, 2012 edition, the National Fire Protection Association, Pamphlet Number 101, known as the Life Safety Code, 2012 edition, and associated pamphlets', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('jurisdiction', 'NE', '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=71-6404', null, '(2) The state building code shall be the building and construction standard within the state and shall be applicable: (a) To all buildings and structures owned by the state or any state agency; (b) In each county, city, or village which elects to adopt the state building code as its local building or construction code pursuant to section 71-6406 ; and (c) In each county, city, or village which has not adopted a local building or construction code pursuant to section 71-6406 within two years after an update to the state building code.', 'Statewide code model, re-checked on the official page.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:ibc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the International Code Council, 2024 International Building Code, known as the "IBC/2024." This code is hereby adopted by reference as the building subcode for New Jersey subject to the modifications stated at (b) below.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:irc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the International Code Council, 2024 International Residential Code known as the IRC/2024 as the one- and two-family dwelling subcode in New Jersey subject to the modifications stated at (c) below.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:state_plumbing:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the Model Code of the International Association of Plumbing and Mechanical Officials, known as "The National Standard Plumbing Code/2024," as the plumbing subcode for New Jersey.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:nec:2023')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the National Fire Protection Association, known as "The National Electrical Code (NEC) 2023," and Tentative Interim Amendments 70- 23-1 through 70-23-13 as the electrical subcode for New Jersey.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:iecc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the International Code Council, known as the International Energy Conservation Code/2024 (IECC/2024), as the energy subcode for New Jersey.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:imc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the International Code Council, Inc., known as the International Mechanical Code/2024. This code is hereby adopted by reference as the Mechanical Subcode for the State of New Jersey', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NJ:ifgc:2024')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_3.pdf', 'b12eebd1b713835217bfd6a98aabd1d272a71c530cdaad232fdf660635ca9c85', 'the Commissioner hereby adopts the model code of the International Code Council, Inc., known as the International Fuel Gas Code/2024. This code is hereby adopted by reference as the fuel gas subcode for the State of New Jersey', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
  ('jurisdiction', 'NJ', '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/njac_5_23_2.pdf', null, '(a) The provisions of the regulations shall apply to all buildings and structures and their appurtenant construction, including vaults, area and street projections, and accessory additions; and shall apply with equal force to municipal, county, State, and private buildings', 'Statewide code model, re-checked on the official page.'),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NM:ibc:2021')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.srca.nm.gov/parts/title14/14.007.0002.html', '04476ee8e1fbf5d2be5bbf60fac2aa2e36e88d377c45a6b1daf9c9c7f44b42f1', '14.7.2.5 EFFECTIVE DATE: July, 14, 2023 , unless a later date is cited at the end of a section. ... 14.7.2.8 ADOPTION OF THE 2021 INTERNATIONAL BUILDING CODE: A. This rule adopts by reference the 2021 International Building Code, as amended by this rule.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
