  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:st:NM:iecc:2021')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.srca.nm.gov/parts/title14/14.007.0006.html', 'c09948a343d5e6499a3c119bf613d7827c4e243984d94edd9d1963a5eec6a477', '14.7.6.5 EFFECTIVE DATE: January 30, 2024 unless a later date is cited at the end of a section. ... 14.7.6.8 ADOPTION OF THE 2021 NEW MEXICO RESIDENTIAL ENERGY CONSERVATION CODE: A. This rule adopts by reference the 2021 international energy conservation code (IECC) , as amended by this rule.', 'Quote re-checked word for word on the official page by the Academy source check.'),
