  ('jurisdiction', 'NV', '2026-11-22T02:26:12Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.leg.state.nv.us/NRS/NRS-278.html', null, '1. Subject to the limitation set forth in NRS 244.368 and 278.586 , the governing body of any city or county may adopt a building code, specifying the design, soundness and materials of structures, and may adopt rules, ordinances and regulations for the enforcement of the building code.', 'Statewide code model, re-checked on the official page.'),
